3. Add assertions to ensure Emergency mode occurs in every test scenario.

=== REQUIREMENT_UPDATES ===
1. R6.1 (Mutual Exclusivity in Normal Mode):
   - Clarify: No user may simultaneously hold two mutually exclusive roles in Normal mode, by any means (assignment or delegation).
2. R4.2a (Emergency Delegation Expiry):
