- Stronger checks needed: Investigate which specific coverage predicate, when added, causes unsatisfiability. Consider running each coverage predicate incrementally on top of R1R2R3R4R5R6R7 to localize the overconstraint. Also, inspect generated instances for the presence/absence of Emergency mode, mutually exclusive roles, and delegations that span Emergency.

INCREMENTAL ANALYSIS:
