Scenario: Skolem $assertAllRequestsEventuallyProcessed_r = Request$2. Request$2 has approvalStatus = Denied$0, requestedBy = User$0, affects = Object$0, classification = C_Medium$0, but processedIn = [] (empty), and approvedOrDeniedBy = [] (empty). In all States, requests sets are empty—no State.requests includes this Request.

